			"notes": "## Location Tooltip 0.6.1\n\nA fix for a crash. Update as soon as you can.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- **The game no longer crashes when an enderman picks up a block.** A helper class for the mob griefing protection was in the wrong package, and the game refused to load it the first time an enderman tried to grab a block near you. It has been in the mod since 0.5.3 and it affected every Minecraft version. It only fired when an enderman was close by, which is why it looked random.\n\n- **The Region Wand and Admin Compass can be crafted on 1.21.11 again.** Their recipes were written in the older format, which 1.21.11 rejects, so both were silently missing from that version.\n\n### Notes\n\n- Each Minecraft version is a separate download. Pick the file that matches your game.\n- Nothing changes for existing worlds or settings.\n\n---\n*Requires Fabric API. Mod Menu and Waystones are optional.*"
		},
